            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-end flex-wrap gap-3 mb-3">
                <div>
                    <span class="customer-promo-eyebrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles me-1"></i> QUICK HIGHLIGHTS SLIDER</span>
